cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use DER in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "DER: Dynamic Experience Runtime"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Gokce
    given-names: Seyit
repository-code: "https://github.com/Serpo-Technology/der"
license: AGPL-3.0-or-later
abstract: >-
  DER turns a natural-language description into a working desktop app.
  A model composes prewritten, signed parts into a declarative contract
  that is validated before it runs, and native and web renderers display
  the result from one shared runtime kernel.
